{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2022-01-05 16:30:00', 'title': 'WEST ANNOUNCES FIRST-QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND AND 2022 SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': "EXTON, PA., JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: WST), A GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS FOR INJECTABLE DRUG ADMINISTRATION, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAVE APPROVED A FIRST-QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND OF $0.18 PER SHARE.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON FEBRUARY 2, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JANUARY 19, 2022."}